OL,3,GNEWSACity library targeted in three
OL,4,Aarson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating three reports
OL,7,Fof arson next to a library after two
OL,8,Fvehicles and some rubbish were set on
OL,9,Ffire in Hull.
OL,11,FOfficers said the incidents at the
OL,12,FAvenues Library on Chanterlands Avenue
OL,13,Foccurred between Monday and Wednesday
OL,14,Fand urged anyone with information,
OL,15,Fincluding CCTV footage from around the
OL,16,Ftime of the incident, to contact them.
OL,18,FHumberside Fire Service said it had
OL,19,Fattended one vehicle on fire on Monday,
OL,20,Fa "small amount" of rubbish that was
OL,21,Fburning in a doorway on Tuesday and a
OL,22,Fcar fire on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
